  "student_passage": "My aunt lives far from her school. “Do you walk to work?” I ask. “No, I go (1) ____,” she says, pointing to the number 8 bus. Her lessons begin at eight (2) ____, not in the evening. At the school gate, there is a large tree (3) ____ the office building. The building is behind the tree.\n\nMy aunt finishes her last lesson at four. She stays for the painting club (4) ____, when all lessons have finished. At six, her friend drives her home. She has dinner, reads a book and goes to bed. She sleeps (5) ____ and works during the day.\n\n词库：A. in the morning　B. by bus　C. in front of　D. after school　E. on foot　F. at night（有一项不用）",
